  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the Vialone Nano rice thoroughly and cook according to package instructions.",
    "In a large pot, combine the chicken broth, soy sauce, and miso paste, and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the sliced pork to the pot and cook until browned.",
